Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life, fighting\Nfor tomorrow. Go get what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life, run\Nlike the wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.74,0:00:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong, believe\Nyou can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going on the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again, you\Nknow what I mean, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Know what you're making my dream. Time to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.02,0:00:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.34,0:00:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know what is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:01:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.64,0:01:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.83,0:01:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest day I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.68,0:01:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can do it, so can you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.44,0:01:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Only without.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.38,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But it won't you more walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.88,0:01:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.52,0:01:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.80,0:01:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you cannot achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your wife that I\Nwant, but you're where it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, and you want more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.60,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:01:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shine like a star to be good, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.70,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tells that you gotta keep your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.64,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.02,0:02:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're safe. Congenal!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.58,0:02:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kin'emon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.94,0:02:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,At long last, my heart dances.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:02:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.18,0:03:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I was troublesome to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I encountered one strange\Noccurrence after another,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,so I thought it might be wise to hide\Nin the wall until danger had passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.22,0:03:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it seems I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.70,0:03:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're truly a remarkable friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.22,0:03:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful that you came back for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.36,0:03:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I kept you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.32,0:03:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Cap, cap, cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.62,0:03:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no cause for regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.80,0:03:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I would gladly wait for my\Nfriend as long as it took.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to my sorcery, I\Nwas able to conceal myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.16,0:03:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I could produce sustenance as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are my married?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.80,0:03:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you have not\Nbeen as fortunate as I.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.74,0:03:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Want some lettuce?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.78,0:03:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your food never agrees with my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha! Ha! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.22,0:03:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust that Momonosuke\Nis in good health as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.58,0:04:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed he is, thanks to you. Good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.94,0:04:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I hope that\Nwe can be reunited soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Momonosuke will be\Neager to see you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.44,0:04:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A great many things have happened\Nsince the two of us parted ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Far too many to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.16,0:04:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Doing so we'll have to wait until another\Ntime we must make haste very well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.12,0:04:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,then let us depart
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.42,0:04:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean they know a way out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.06,0:04:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Painting what's that gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.02,0:04:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come forth
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Spring Sparrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.22,0:04:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.86,0:05:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have devil-proof powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.40,0:05:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's moving on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.40,0:05:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The picture of a bird just came to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.16,0:05:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a crappy artist, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.56,0:05:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an amazing power, but\Nhe can't draw birds at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.24,0:05:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor thing can barely fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Kin'emon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.78,0:05:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Away we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.80,0:05:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.68,0:05:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The people here are King Riku's soldiers\Nand citizens who were once toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to know if King\NRick is alive, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're so lost right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Our families are waiting for us up in this\Ncity—is there any way you can take us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.52,0:05:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.06,0:06:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.97,0:06:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try aiming at us too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.82,0:06:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,too
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.06,0:06:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Guillotine high-heeled!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.20,0:06:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The long-legged guy got beat! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.70,0:06:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Eyes forward, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We have one objective, and that's\Nmaking it to Doflamingo's palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.84,0:06:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment that I heard him make\Nthat announcement to everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized the bitter truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.48,0:06:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Your objective is to assassinate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.68,0:06:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,it's kill or be killed every person in
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.62,0:06:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,the kingdom is now a bounty hunter and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,the only way for you to survive it's\Nfree to take the life of another person
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.24,0:06:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,the so-called game of his\Nis nothing but a death trap
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.72,0:07:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as Doflamingo's weapon\Ntrafficking was revealed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.12,0:07:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,along with the truth of the toys,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.50,0:07:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I suspect that every person in this\Nkingdom was given a death sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.66,0:07:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo won't let any\Ninformation escape from Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.94,0:07:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the real reason why he locked\Nthe kingdom inside this birdcage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.24,0:07:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do you realize what the situation is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's created a solitary island cut\Noff from the rest of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.78,0:07:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The citizens,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,who are waiting for a miracle or trying\Nto play the game, will all be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.86,0:07:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way to escape the\Nisland and save its people from
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.08,0:07:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,this massacre is to get rid of\NDoflamingo before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.46,0:07:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The kingdom has been\Nthrown into absolute chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.10,0:07:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But even though the situation\Nis spiraling out of control,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.92,0:07:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,strangely, Doflamingo seems\Nto be enjoying himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the most cunning\Nadversary I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.74,0:08:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, despite his strength and\Nobvious advantages in this situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.74,0:08:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo still made one key error.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He held a tournament at the Coliseum\Nand invited an army of powerful and,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,more importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.10,0:08:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,strong-willed fighters into his kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.44,0:08:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we'll submit to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.26,0:08:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I will defeat Doflamingo\Nwith my own hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.38,0:08:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop saying that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.02,0:08:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I already called Gibbs on\NMingo like a million times!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.98,0:08:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.30,0:08:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.64,0:08:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,While your passion is\Nadmirable, this is my fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.74,0:08:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you wanted one of the\Nexecutives and nobody complained!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,As a personal matter, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.08,0:08:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's my duty to take back this\Nkingdom in the name of King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.72,0:08:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,For ten years, I have waited\Nto put an end to this tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.12,0:08:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, my grudge is from 13 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.50,0:08:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.41,0:09:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then mine is from 30 years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.80,0:09:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Dirty liar! You're not 30!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not even as old as I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.46,0:09:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off my horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.00,0:09:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You get off my horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.68,0:09:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.10,0:09:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you get for inviting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.92,0:09:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We're at the end of the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.64,0:09:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.94,0:09:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the third level!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.24,0:09:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, ignore that and\Nkeep running like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.38,0:09:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight up to the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.50,0:09:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.08,0:09:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something the matter, Foggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.32,0:09:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy, what the heck are those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:10:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Just saying, if this is all you've got,\Nyou never had a chance against my captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.70,0:10:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Little... twat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.20,0:10:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.48,0:10:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here and why are you flying?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.80,0:10:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.71,0:10:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, do I get to see Mr. Zoro fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.72,0:10:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stuck in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.46,0:10:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta get down there\Nand get an autograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.82,0:10:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, that's Pika.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.28,0:10:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.30,0:10:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the top executive from the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.54,0:10:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,with the same rank as Treble and Diamante.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, keep the enemy right\Nthere. Huh? We're going up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to pass over this stone figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.56,0:11:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.47,0:11:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That should be easy enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.24,0:11:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to figure\Nout how you're flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.76,0:11:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like our enemy ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.06,0:11:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, he tricked us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.46,0:11:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get to the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's back inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.22,0:11:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.16,0:11:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's aiming straight for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.08,0:11:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.70,0:11:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta use my hands for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.34,0:11:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Being fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.42,0:11:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.92,0:11:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause any second now\Nwe're gonna get smashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.80,0:11:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just never reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.12,0:11:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Three sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,1,080-caliber phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.52,0:12:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I get how your power works.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.62,0:12:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I forgot to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You've underestimated the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.04,0:12:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupi and Usopp aren't the only\Nones you need to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.62,0:12:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,See this face?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.94,0:12:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking at the\Nman who's going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.54,0:12:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the greatest swordsman\Nin the world someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.94,0:12:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Sorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.34,0:12:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I would be thrilled to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.20,0:12:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,One moment, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.74,0:13:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.92,0:13:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.32,0:13:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We can finally get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.86,0:13:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Take turns climbing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.68,0:13:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The ladders are not particularly sturdy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.14,0:13:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We could climb better if\Nthe lines were straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.50,0:13:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's just hurtful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.98,0:13:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.24,0:13:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The little people are causing a riot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.42,0:13:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We need backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.06,0:13:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.04,0:13:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just too fast to hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep firing. You'll get one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.54,0:13:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are bad and your aim is bad, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.80,0:13:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never beat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.60,0:14:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you can't? Aren't you worried\Nabout Princess Mon Cherie? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.48,0:14:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to take care of her\Nbecause she's so sick if you leave
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.02,0:14:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,the factory with her then how\Nis she ever gonna get better?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.64,0:14:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even consider that. He's\Ntricking us. You can't listen, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's put this business\Nbehind us and get back to work, okay
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.52,0:14:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I put in earplugs. So I can't\Nhear your nasty lies anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.16,0:14:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Santana, swing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.60,0:14:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Call the young master. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.46,0:14:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys better not!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.06,0:14:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Tantata tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.56,0:14:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ford and Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's release\Ntheir transponder snails.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If we do that, they won't be\Nable to call for backup anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.30,0:15:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you paying attention? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.46,0:15:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your earplugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pleased to know her illness was alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.10,0:15:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But to think that she's been alone\Nall this time in the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.34,0:15:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How sad she must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess, your loyal Mouji understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.44,0:15:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can practically see\Nthe tears on your cheeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.26,0:15:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, I can practically hear\Nyou calling out my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mouji, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the isolation ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.92,0:15:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Moucherie must be in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.20,0:15:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.64,0:15:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, you can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.48,0:15:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.84,0:15:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that sign up on the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.42,0:15:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It says keep out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.12,0:15:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That means we can't go in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.68,0:15:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.59,0:15:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What a tragedy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.82,0:15:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't anyone tell me until now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.18,0:15:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's far too late for me to slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.42,0:15:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He crashed right through that door like\Nthe keep out sign wasn't even there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.30,0:15:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so disappointed in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.24,0:16:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Your blatant disregard for\Nthe rules makes us look bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.12,0:16:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.24,0:16:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.10,0:16:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everybody ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.84,0:16:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Lurch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.60,0:16:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.80,0:16:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.54,0:16:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're so relentless, señor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.92,0:16:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.44,0:16:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky Ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.10,0:16:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike the rest of his body, his\Nears have no mechanical advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,However, his hearing is naturally\Nquite good, so he gets along just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.90,0:16:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.58,0:16:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's been bugging me, hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the kind of thing you'd\Ncare about. I guess, but uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.96,0:16:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,earlier I saw this sweet old granny having
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.38,0:16:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,a tough time on that street over there,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:16:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and it darn near broke my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.38,0:17:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.82,0:17:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure hate to see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.34,0:17:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast, little shrimps.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm gonna let you out better?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember who's in charge of this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.42,0:17:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.33,0:17:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in big trouble now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.75,0:17:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You twerps have been\Nhere all this time and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.08,0:17:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,you just now realized\Nyou're nothing but slaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.60,0:17:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put you back to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.14,0:17:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Break time is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.46,0:17:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be layabout!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.04,0:17:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.38,0:17:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't come up with\Nsomething quick, we're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.34,0:17:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our only hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.68,0:18:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work, now let's party!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.48,0:18:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a robot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.64,0:18:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,A big strong robot game to save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.50,0:18:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.86,0:18:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The robots are awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.40,0:18:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everybody okay? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.68,0:18:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.06,0:18:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We're breaking all you guys out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.78,0:18:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.70,0:18:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Good for you. Thank you, Mr. Robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.54,0:18:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a name and he's not a robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.92,0:18:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a big person. The\Ngreat hero known as Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.54,0:18:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of person is\Nthis princess of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.64,0:18:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, where does that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.62,0:18:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ignore me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.34,0:18:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We never settle things between\Nus, you bunch of little dolts!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.26,0:19:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The factory is my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.04,0:19:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the manager, you punks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.06,0:19:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,When they call me to the scene,\Nyou know you're in for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.96,0:19:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Cyborg Franky from the\NStraw Hat Pirates, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.54,0:19:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you only had a one-star bounty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you make it this far\Nwith a target on your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.04,0:19:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Senor Pink should have\Nstopped you. Yeah? You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.04,0:19:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, this is my factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.78,0:19:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you have the run of the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.08,0:19:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You step up to this lady, you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.82,0:19:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Frolin, be careful. She's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.40,0:19:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Frolin gave the man Julie a great big hug!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.22,0:19:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the big idea here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.38,0:19:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being weird. Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.36,0:19:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Valen just keeps hugging her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.44,0:19:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard fooled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.92,0:20:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That dirty, lying cyborg.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.42,0:20:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I was all worried about that\Ngranny, but she isn't even real.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at least I don't have to worry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.14,0:20:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so are Niles!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.04,0:20:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Senor Pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to go again anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.87,0:20:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not appropriate behavior for a\Nworkplace environment, okay? You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.90,0:20:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,that big baby has been rattling my head\Nwith suplexes one after another all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.26,0:20:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.17,0:20:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.22,0:20:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he thought my head was a jackhammer\Nand he was trying to dig himself a hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.42,0:20:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You've really lost it, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.42,0:20:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.98,0:20:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Cat Ear Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.54,0:20:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ranky Southland Suplex!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.86,0:21:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, she's really mad. Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.32,0:21:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurts, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.94,0:21:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't your mama ever tell you\Nthat's no way to treat a lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.94,0:21:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can get away with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.84,0:21:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.75,0:21:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,In my factory?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.67,0:21:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the manager here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.80,0:21:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That means nobody is above me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.68,0:21:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care how nice your hugs are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.28,0:21:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Once she gets this mad,\Nthere's no stopping her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.10,0:21:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away, Froland!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.86,0:21:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna cut you into tiny pieces,\Nthen suck them up with my vacuum,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.04,0:21:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,then dump them out and stomp on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.54,0:21:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,then suck them up all over again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.30,0:21:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So start crying, not that\Nit'll do you any good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.10,0:21:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Froland gave the manager a great big kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.36,0:21:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My, how daring!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.20,0:22:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He stole a kiss from these sweet lips!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.94,0:22:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You gonna lay there and drown, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.36,0:22:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.86,0:22:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.12,0:22:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you felt that way about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.52,0:22:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's moving so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.76,0:22:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's how you feel about a girl,\Nthen you should ask her out first, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.74,0:22:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I never knew she had a girly side.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.82,0:22:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.04,0:22:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It ain't his fault, Miss Manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.30,0:22:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it goes. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.56,0:22:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Love's got nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.76,0:22:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though he kissed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.72,0:22:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Because you caught him\Nduring a sacred fight between two men.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.82,0:22:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He had to seal those lips somehow, and\Na smooch is the easiest way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.60,0:22:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,One little kiss ain't no thing, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.20,0:22:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a battlefield, not\Nsome daycare playground.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.66,0:22:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm looking for\Nromance in a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.88,0:22:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.50,0:22:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who needs baby love?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.50,0:23:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're living in a man's world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.48,0:23:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so hard-boiled!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.94,0:23:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky! Senor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.34,0:23:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the perfect hard-boiled duo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.40,0:23:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let you\Nwreck this factory, robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.10,0:23:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then prove it with your\Nfists, if you're a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.80,0:23:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.06,0:23:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna get so manly!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.42,0:23:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Diaper bombs!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.60,0:23:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nipple Light Special!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.04,0:23:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you stop turning\Ninto rocks and fight me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.74,0:23:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost had them and now\NRebecca's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.68,0:23:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.64,0:23:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't have done it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.40,0:23:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your friends are\Ngonna die in this cage!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.74,0:24:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There could be enemies\Nwaiting on the second level.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.14,0:24:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's be careful where we jump off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.40,0:24:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Leo here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.86,0:24:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Mouji.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.08,0:24:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good, you're free.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.76,0:24:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that means\Neveryone else is too then?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.22,0:24:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed we are, but I have some awful news.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.02,0:24:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what is it, Mouji?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.90,0:24:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The princess, Princess Moucherie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.12,0:24:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems she isn't at the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.88,0:24:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The poor little dear, she must\Nbe locked up somewhere awful,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.06,0:24:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,calling my name again and again!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.16,0:24:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.42,0:24:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,March to the old king's plateau!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.00,0:24:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Surround King Rick and God Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.16,0:24:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing to be scared of just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.20,0:24:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a good spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.40,0:24:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows if they can\Neven climb up this high.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.00,0:24:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Find God Usopp and string him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.10,0:24:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I have good news!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.48,0:24:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All the Tontaras have been set free!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.42,0:24:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? At the factory? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.56,0:25:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But, they said they can't\Nfind Princess Mon Cherie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.92,0:25:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.28,0:25:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,None of that matters right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.04,0:25:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the whole\Nkingdom is trying to kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.42,0:25:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.10,0:25:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If everyone in the whole kingdom is after\Nus, then there's nowhere safe to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.06,0:25:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.34,0:25:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Now they all know the truth\Nabout what happened in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.72,0:25:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The people won't harm father.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.28,0:25:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.34,0:25:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What about me? Viola. Yes? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.44,0:25:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're hiding Princess Monchery, she\Nmust be somewhere in the royal palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.40,0:25:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She must be well hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.74,0:25:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Search every nook and cranny.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.78,0:25:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The flamingo wouldn't be\Nfoolish enough to kill Monchery.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.68,0:25:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Her ability is far too\Nvaluable for him to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.58,0:25:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, we could use that\Nability ourselves at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.66,0:26:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.76,0:26:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.50,0:26:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to go back to Green Bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.68,0:26:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't anybody come save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.48,0:26:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo!
